    candidate edits: 1 asked for, 0 set aside, none used
    pairs: 0 settled by the run, 4 put to the model, 0 dropped as not worth asking, 245 skipped once the defect was covered
    provider_of (line 258) returns `head if separator else None`, so any bare model name such as `claude-sonnet-4-...` gets provider None. _observe_call (line 834) records that None, and summarize (line 240) only adds cost to the Anthropic figures when provider == ANTHROPIC. This is already the DEFECTIVE behaviour. The repair maps a bare name starting with `claude` to ANTHROPIC and leaves other bare names as None.

